  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Small Bot, Big Emotions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bring your CUBY to life with movement and lights. The floating irises make it look like CUBY is always following you with its eyes. The unique illuminated 3D eyes are not only cute but express emotions with different colors and patterns that can be personalized with the CyberBrick app."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Make it yours"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Bring character to your CUBY with different accessories. Print your style from the expanding library of accessories in MakerWorld or remix and design your own."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Precision movement"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "CUBY features a great range of movement for such a small robot. Direct control to each of its four servo motors gives you full power over its movement. Can you master the one-legged turn?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Full directional control"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mastering CUBY is like learning to walk again - literally. Walking, turning, dancing and jumping all take practice. The reward is seeing your CUBY come to life with every step … and fall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Quick access Core"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "At the heart of CUBY is the CyberBrick Core and the battery that powers it. Both are easily accessible for swapping by squeezing and lifting the head open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Remote Control Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This model is designed to work with the CyberBrick Remote. The pre-configured settings have been uploaded for immediate play,"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "while the CyberBrick App allows full customization of controller functions to match your personal preferences."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Please visit the CyberBrick Official Standard Remote on Makerworld for more details."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "CyberBrick App Connection Tutorial"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "*The following is the App connection of CyberBrick Official SoccerBot as an example, which is similar to this model."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Core Safety Rules"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product is intended for users aged 14 and above. Users under the age of 14 must be under direct adult supervision throughout use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT touch the moving parts while the device is operating to prevent pinching injuries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please use only official tools for any firmware operations. Flashing with third-party tools is not supported and may cause irreversible damage, which is not covered by warranty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Before use, inspect all 3D-printed parts and sand down any sharp edges or burrs if present. Store the model and small parts in a location out of reach of children and pets to prevent choking hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Warning of Lithium Battery"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product utilizes a replaceable rechargeable lithium battery."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Adult supervision is required when children are handling batteries or the charger. Do not operate the product while it is charging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Ensure the battery is installed correctly. Improper installation may result in short circuits, overheating, or potential explosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Regularly inspect the charger’s cord, plug, housing, and other components for damage. If any damage is found, discontinue use immediately until the device is fully repaired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Choking Hazard: Contains small parts; not suitable for children under 3 years of age."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Improper disposal of this product may harm the environment - please recycle responsibly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Charging Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Use only the officially supplied charger. The charger is not a toy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The USB charger for this product only supports standard 5V 1-2A input. Please always use the original charger that meets the voltage/current requirements, or charge directly via a computer USB port. DO NOT use chargers with output higher than 5V or 2A (such as mobile fast chargers, 9V/12V adapters, etc.), as this may cause device damage, overheating, or even serious fire hazards."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT cover the device while charging, and keep it away from high temperature, humidity, or flammable environments. Never charge the device unattended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT charge the battery pack if it is overheating. Allow it to cool down completely before recharging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "If the battery pack or charger becomes wet, ensure they are thoroughly dry before attempting to charge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Lithium Battery Safety Precautions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT attempt to use or charge the battery pack if it shows any signs of leakage or corrosion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT disassemble, crush, or mechanically abuse the battery pack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "DO NOT dispose of the battery pack in fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Exercise extreme caution when handling an overheated battery pack."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Small Bot, Big Emotions</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"module-content\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Bring your CUBY to life with movement and lights. The floating irises make it look like CUBY is always following you with its eyes. The unique illuminated 3D eyes are not only cute but express emotions with different colors and patterns that can be personalized with the CyberBrick app.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/b33f09088b3a4bf6abe6c2f17f1706e2/8054.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/b33f09088b3a4bf6abe6c2f17f1706e2/8054.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/b33f09088b3a4bf6abe6c2f17f1706e2/8054.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 第2卖点 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Make it yours</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Bring character to your CUBY with different accessories. Print your style from the expanding library of accessories in MakerWorld or remix and design your own.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/387eeaa9b6b84a01ab61895f22de07a9/8092.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/387eeaa9b6b84a01ab61895f22de07a9/8092.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/387eeaa9b6b84a01ab61895f22de07a9/8092.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Precision movement</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"module-content\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">CUBY features a great range of movement for such a small robot. Direct control to each of its four servo motors gives you full power over its movement. Can you master the one-legged turn?</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/e33efb4e767d41c0a66801706798fc24/8064.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/e33efb4e767d41c0a66801706798fc24/8064.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/e33efb4e767d41c0a66801706798fc24/8064.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 第2卖点 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Full directional control</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Mastering CUBY is like learning to walk again - literally. Walking, turning, dancing and jumping all take practice. The reward is seeing your CUBY come to life with every step … and fall.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/98ade897d70a4157a690829cbc17cb3b/8057.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/98ade897d70a4157a690829cbc17cb3b/8057.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/98ade897d70a4157a690829cbc17cb3b/8057.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Quick access Core</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"module-content\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">At the heart of CUBY is the CyberBrick Core and the battery that powers it. Both are easily accessible for swapping by squeezing and lifting the head open.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f75ba59c89c74a778d5799c0eda71282/8063.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f75ba59c89c74a778d5799c0eda71282/8063.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f75ba59c89c74a778d5799c0eda71282/8063.mp4\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<p></p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px;\">Remote Control Instruction</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\">This model is designed to work with the CyberBrick Remote. The pre-configured settings have been uploaded for immediate play,</p>\n<p>while the CyberBrick App allows full customization of controller functions to match your personal preferences.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">* Please visit the <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1395991-cyberbrick-official-standard-remote#profileId-1446992\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">CyberBrick Official Standard Remote on Makerworld </span></strong></a> for more details.</span></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style>\n        .image-container {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 30px; \n            justify-content: center; \n            align-items: center; \n            height: auto; \n        }\n        .image-container img {\n            width: 650px;\n            height: flex;\n            object-fit: contain; \n        }\n    </style>\n<div class=\"image-container\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/49220a859e534f308c895155c93ab934/ControlScheme.png\" height=\"527\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"738\"/> <a href=\"https://bambulab.com/en/download/cyberbrick-apps\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/c822010a332c4bf6b9c6ec5db116a293/Frame_1123867487.jpg\" height=\"527\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"735\"/></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">CyberBrick App Connection Tutorial</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: -40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>*The following is the App connection of CyberBrick Official SoccerBot as an example, which is similar to this model.</em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">In The Box</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse; height: 103px;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; height: 26px;\"><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%; height: 26px;\"><strong>ZL026</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%; height: 26px;\"><strong>ZL026-1</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px; height: 50px;\">\n<div class=\"hover-img-container\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"../../products/cyberbrick-hardware-kit?id=593290263704776711\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae57;\" target=\"_blank\">CyberBrick Beginner Hardware Kit - ZK004</a></strong></span></p>\n<img class=\"hover-img product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-puls